# Declarative manifest of Claude Code plugins for this machine.
# Synced by hooks/post-up/claude-plugins on `rcup`.
#
# Format: <plugin>@<marketplace> [<marketplace-source>]
#   - <marketplace-source> is `owner/repo` for GitHub, a URL, or a local path.
#     Required the first time a marketplace is referenced; optional afterward.
#   - Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#   - Plugins and marketplaces not listed here will be uninstalled.
#   - claude/settings.json's enabledPlugins is a separate on/off toggle for
#     already-installed plugins, not a source of truth for this manifest
#     (it can't express "should not be installed"). If a plugin is
#     enabled=true there but missing here, the hook warns instead of
#     silently uninstalling it — add it here too when that happens.

